          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px;"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg>
